      "side": 1,
      "message": "The AvbFooter is only there for libavb to locate the VBMeta and isn\u0027t covered by the signing process (nor is it hashed during verification); yes, please look at the libavb implementation for further details. With an offset of 30, you\u0027re corrupting `AvbFooter::vbmeta_size`, which I guess makes the verification reject it. An offset of 1 corrupts the magic, making the footer impossible to find and 10 corrupts its `version_minor`.",
